# CVE allowlist for the Java dependency audit (trivy sbom over the CycloneDX SBOM,
# run via `./arcogine check --full` or `cd product && ./gradlew cyclonedxBom`).
#
# Only CVEs in dependencies that are NOT shipped in the deployable
# (cli's arcogine.jar) are listed here — they come from test-only or
# build-only configurations and do not affect the running application.
# Shipped-runtime CVEs are deliberately NOT suppressed and will fail the gate.

# Netty codecs — pulled only by spring-boot-starter-webflux, which is a
# testImplementation dependency (the WebTestClient reactive client used by the
# interfaces/api integration tests). Not on any module's runtimeClasspath / in the jar.
CVE-2026-42583
CVE-2026-42579
CVE-2026-42584
CVE-2026-42587
CVE-2026-42582
CVE-2026-42577

# plexus-utils — build-time tooling (Gradle/CycloneDX machinery). Not shipped.
